      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAVOC TWO (4) took the sit on the lead but levelled up to score (30.82) at this track in a Grade 5 over 525m. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. CAWBOURNE DOLLAR (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Pay Time (23.30) in a Grade 4/5. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Can measure up. CAWBOURNE CALI (1) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at this track over 400m behind Cawbourne Mia (23.85) in a Grade 5. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expected to feature in the finish. CAWBOURNE LADY (5) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
